Here's a deployable solution in two parts:


Part 1: 

Durable Functions-Based Archival System

This solution uses:

  > Azure Durable Functions (Python) for orchestration

  > Blob Storage as archive

  > Cosmos DB SDK for record operations


Requirements: 
Install the following in your environment (Bash Command):
pip install azure-functions azure-storage-blob azure-cosmos

Durable Function Structure


BillingArchival/
│
├── __init__.py               # Entry point for orchestration
├── get_old_records.py        # Gets old records from Cosmos DB
├── archive_to_blob.py        # Uploads record to Blob
├── delete_from_cosmos.py     # Deletes record from Cosmos DB
└── host.json                 # Azure Functions config

